  "contentHtml": "<p><span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\"auto\">Sketchup <strong>Vray Realistic interior</strong> Rendering Welcome to our comprehensive 2-hour tutorial on creating stunning, photorealistic interior renderings using SketchUp and V-Ray! Whether you&#8217;re a beginner looking to improve your skills or an experienced user wanting to refine your techniques, this tutorial has something for everyone.</span></p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S3GumreNuuA?si=XFAW-C7DkwZC1uKA\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></p>\n<h2>Sketchup <strong>Vray Realistic interior</strong> Rendering Video List</h2>\n<p>Timestamp ;<br />\n<span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"yt-core-attributed-string__link yt-core-attributed-string__link--call-to-action-color\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S3GumreNuuA&amp;t=19s\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener\">00:00:19</a></span><span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\"auto\"> Sketchup Vray Part 1 Modeling<br />\n</span><span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"yt-core-attributed-string__link yt-core-attributed-string__link--call-to-action-color\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S3GumreNuuA&amp;t=2640s\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener\">00:44:00</a></span><span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\"auto\"> Sketchup Vray Part 2 Coloring<br />\n</span><span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"yt-core-attributed-string__link yt-core-attributed-string__link--call-to-action-color\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S3GumreNuuA&amp;t=2769s\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener\">00:46:09</a></span><span class=\"yt-core-attributed-string--link-inherit-color\" dir=\